00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:52.860
Now let's say you are a
hospital with multiple sites.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.930
As your patients move from
one hospital to another,

00:00:55.930 --> 00:01:00.150
how do you bring all their
data together longitudinally?

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:02.070
Or maybe you are an
insurance provider

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:05.700
and want to adjust and analyze
your patient information

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:08.310
in bulk, as well
