imaging records more seamless,

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:22.830
yet safe to access
between health care

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:25.170
providers and their patients.

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:26.850
Or you may be a
research organization

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:28.470
