00:01:36.383 --> 00:01:37.800
And on top of that,
the stakes are

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:40.950
high if you don't align your
data processes to government

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:44.790
regulations, which could incur
very expensive fines for not

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:47.620
understanding new
policies as they evolve.

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:50.910
This is where the Healthcare
API and Google Cloud's HIPAA

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:54.270
compliant tools help reduce
that friction, since it offers

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:56.670
