zero-trust model,

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:27.870
which has multiple layers of
security from our data center

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:29.280
all the way to your browser.

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:31.980
And all products stated
in the terms of service

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:33.750
are HIPAA compliant.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.330
We know how sensitive
your data is and want

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:38.250
